# The Siren's Tear (bastok 0): Wahid and Echo Hawk in Bastok Mines, Otto and Carmelo in Port Bastok. No guard: Wahid's
# offer 81 (Echo Hawk plays 5 while it is available); while accepted Otto's 5 at Prog 0 and Carmelo's 6 (Prog 1); a
# Siren's Tear (given here by GM: North Gustaberg's moving qm1 gives it through its own script, with no quest read) at
# Wahid plays 82 (completed: 150 gil, fame +10, Tearjerker, the tear taken); once completed Carmelo's 19 (Prog under 2, no
# tear held: Prog 2), and the tear at Wahid plays 82 again, which pays the reward again.
# Defaults: Wahid 28, Echo Hawk 13, Otto 20, Carmelo 182 (DefaultActions; no scripts). Echo Hawk is Lure of the Wildcat
# (Bastok)'s (group 9: accepted only); Carmelo is Love and Ice's, A Test of True Love's and Lovers in the Dusk's (C#:
# Love and Ice needs the Carrier Pigeon Letter seen, the others need Love and Ice completed; all silent here).
lists BastokMines/Wahid/onTrigger BastokMines/Wahid/onTrade BastokMines/Echo_Hawk/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/81 BastokMines/onEventFinish/82 PortBastok/Otto/onTrigger PortBastok/Carmelo/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/6 PortBastok/onEventFinish/19
char zone=BastokMines pos=26.3,0,-64.9
item BoneChip
login
trade Wahid BoneChip x1              # available: no trade handler in any matching section, nothing
trigger Echo_Hawk                    # available: 5
finish
trigger Wahid                        # the offer, 81
finish                               # accepted
trigger Echo_Hawk                    # accepted: no handler, 13
finish-if-event
warp -145.9,-7.5,12.2 PortBastok
trigger Otto                         # Prog 0: 5
finish
trigger Carmelo                      # accepted: 6
finish                               # Prog 1
trigger Otto                         # Prog 1: nil, 20
finish-if-event
trigger Carmelo                      # 6 again (no Prog guard)
finish                               # Prog 1
item SirensTear
warp 26.3,0,-64.9 BastokMines
trade Wahid BoneChip x1              # accepted, the wrong item: nil
trade Wahid SirensTear x1            # 82
finish                               # completed: 150 gil, fame +10, Tearjerker, the tear taken
trigger Wahid                        # completed: no trigger handler, 28
finish-if-event
warp -145.9,-7.5,12.2 PortBastok
trigger Carmelo                      # completed, Prog 0 (the completion's cleanup), no tear: 19
finish                               # Prog 2
trigger Carmelo                      # Prog 2: nil, 182
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[1][0]Prog 0
item SirensTear
trigger Carmelo                      # Prog 0, the tear held: nil, 182
finish-if-event
trigger Otto                         # completed: no handler, 20
finish-if-event
warp 26.3,0,-64.9 BastokMines
trade Wahid SirensTear x1            # completed: 82 again
finish                               # completed again: 150 gil, fame +10, the tear taken
